meta {
  name: Assign vehicle (workaround via PUT)
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/master/drivers/{{lastDriverId}}
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "assigned_vehicle_id": "{{lastVehicleId}}"
  }
}

docs {
  # Asignar vehiculo a driver

  **No existe endpoint dedicado `/assign-vehicle`** (backend responde 404).

  En su lugar usamos el PUT genérico con el campo `assigned_vehicle_id`.
  Para desasignar, mandar `"assigned_vehicle_id": null`.

  **Requisito:** correr antes `05-Master-Vehicles/02-Create.bru` para setear `lastVehicleId`.
}
